### Register
# @name register
POST http://localhost:5167/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "JohnDoe",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login (registered user)
# @name login1
POST http://localhost:5167/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "JohnDoe",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token1", response.body.token);
%}

### Get me (authorized)
GET http://localhost:5167/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### Login (unregistered user) - expected to fail
# @name login2
POST http://localhost:5167/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "LarryPizza",
  "password": "Password1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token2", response.body?.token || "invalid-token");
%}

### Get me (unauthorized) - expected to fail
GET http://localhost:5167/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}